  "bodyHash": "ad3657c1d197ef3b",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Mod. Made with love. Lots of active mods for Fabric, Forge and Neo!\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"About the mod\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Adventure Mode Tweaks 对冒险模式的游戏机制进行了各种调整，正如你所猜到的那样。这个想法源于意识到玩家可以破坏画作，这显然不应该发生。此后，该功能在此基础上得到了扩展。<br><br>例如，如果没有这个模组，你可以破坏矿车但不能放置它们；而船只则可以既破坏又放置。对于 RPG 地图制作者来说，破坏拴绳可能也是非预期的。所有内容都是可配置的，因此你可以选择确切地启用或禁用哪些功能。<br><br>你还可以使用该模组让所有新玩家在冒险模式中生成。如果你有一个使用特定场景的整合包，这将非常有用。更多信息请参阅下方的功能和图片！<br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">功能：</span>（在冒险模式下）</strong><br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 所有设置完全可配置。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 在新世界中强制使用冒险模式，包括界面更新。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 防止被动和/或敌对生物的攻击。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 防止用户破坏画作。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 防止破坏物品展示框，但允许取出物品。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 放置和破坏船只与矿车（或者禁用此功能）。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 完全禁止实体交互。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 防止破坏和使用拴绳。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 防止使用末影珍珠。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 禁用在床上睡觉的功能。<br>&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 禁用钓鱼和/或钩取实体。<br>&&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 防止剪羊毛和/或挤牛奶。<br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; 防止已放置的 TNT 被点燃。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"Dependencies\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"Requires Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"Environment: Client &amp; Server\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"Configurable\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"Configuration guide\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>forceSurvivalToAdventureMode</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">全局将生存模式更改为冒险模式。这是在玩家加入世界时完成的。创建世界屏幕的界面也会相应更新。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventAttackingCreatureMobs</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">阻止冒险模式中的玩家伤害被动生物。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventAttackingMonsterMobs</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">防止冒险模式中的玩家攻击敌对生物。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventEntityInteraction</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在冒险模式下禁用右键点击实体的交互。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventDestroyingPaintings</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">冒险模式玩家无法破坏画作。在原版 Minecraft 中这是允许的。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventDestroyingItemFrames</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在冒险模式下防止破坏物品展示框。在原版 Minecraft 中这是允许的。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventLootingItemFrames</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">阻止冒险模式玩家从物品展示框中取出物品。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventBreakingMinecarts</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">防止冒险模式中的玩家破坏矿车。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>allowPlacingMinecarts</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允许即使在冒险模式下也能放置矿车。原版 Minecraft 的行为是不允许放置。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventBreakingBoats</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">防止冒险模式中的玩家破坏船只。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>allowPlacingBoats</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">允许在冒险模式下放置船只。原版 Minecraft 的行为是允许放置。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventCreeperBlockDamage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">阻止苦力怕在冒险模式玩家附近爆炸时破坏方块。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventUseOfEnderPearls</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">阻止冒险模式玩家使用末影珍珠。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventBedSleeping</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在冒险模式下防止在床上睡觉。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventLightningTNT</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">防止冒险模式玩家用火石和钢点燃 TNT。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventFishing</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">冒险模式玩家不能使用钓鱼竿。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventFishingRodHookedEntities</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">阻止持有钓鱼竿的玩家在冒险模式下钩住实体。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventUseOfLeads</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">防止在冒险模式下使用和破坏拴绳。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventCowMilking</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在冒险模式下防止给奶牛挤奶。如果启用了 'preventEntityInteraction'，则此项多余。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>preventSheepShearing</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">阻止冒险模式玩家剪羊毛。如果启用了 'preventEntityInteraction'，则此项多余。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"Showcase\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>能够在创建世界界面强制设置冒险模式。默认关闭：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/adventure-mode-tweaks/a.png\" alt=\"\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>防止画作和物品展示框被破坏，但保留拾取战利品的能力：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/adventure-mode-tweaks/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>能够放置和破坏船只与矿车。或者不这样做，完全可配置：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/adventure-mode-tweaks/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>仅针对冒险模式玩家阻止苦力怕的方块破坏：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/adventure-mode-tweaks/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"Notes and links\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模组，只要下载仍然托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论已禁用，因为我无法在许多单独的模组页面之间跟踪它们。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>关于问题、想法、建议或其他任何事宜，请前往 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
